OL,3,AWhat's gone wrong at Britain's worst
OL,4,Abathing site?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe official sign on the banks of the
OL,7,FRiver Tone at French Weir Park in
OL,8,FTaunton advises people not to swim.
OL,10,FBut that hasn't stopped Jo, Jenny, Sue
OL,11,Fand a second Jo from enjoying a regular
OL,12,Fdip together.
OL,14,F"People think, oh you're swimming down
OL,15,Fby the supermarket, that can't be very
OL,16,Fnice, but it's gorgeous," Jenny Hillier
OL,17,Fsays, as the women huddle round with
OL,18,Ftheir coats and hot drinks after a
OL,19,Fbracing October plunge.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
